<title>USA: Mednet, Bergen Brunswig settle suits.</title>
<headline>Mednet, Bergen Brunswig settle suits.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mednet MPC Corp said on Monday it had agreed in principle to settle pending lawsuits with Bergen Brunswig Corp.</p>
<p>Mednet declined to elaborate on terms of the agreement.</p>
<p>The proposed settlement resolves a disputed $7.1 million trade payable to Bergen and claims asserted against Bergen by Mednet.</p>
<p>The non-binding settlement is subject to execution of mutually acceptable documentation and other contingencies. There can be no assurance that a settlement will be consummated, Mednet said.</p>
</text>
